hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1072","Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala and Saeed bin Abdul-Rahman Al-Makhzoumi told us, Sufyan told us, on the authority of Al-Zuhri, on the authority of Salem, on the authority of his father, On the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said. H And Abdul Jabbar told us, Sufyan, on the authority of Amr, on the authority of Tawus, he heard it from Ibn Omar, and Ibn Abi Labid, on the authority of Abu Salamah, on the authority of Ibn Omar, H. Al-Makhzoumi told us, Sufyan told us, on the authority of Amr bin Dinar, on the authority of Tawus, on the authority of Ibn Omar. H And Abdul Rahman bin Bishr told us, Sufyan, on the authority of Al-Zuhri, on the authority of Salim, on the authority of his father, and Abdullah bin Dinar, on the authority of Ibn Umar, On the authority of Amr, on the authority of Tawus, on the authority of Ibn Omar. H Abdul-Jabbar and Saeed bin Abdul-Rahman told us, saying: Sufyan told us, on the authority of Abdullah bin Dinar, Abdul-Jabbar said: He heard Ibn Omar, says: Al-Makhzoumi said: On the authority of Abdullah bin Omar, and Ahmad bin Mani’, Ma’mal bin Hisham, and Ziyad bin Ayyub narrated to us. They said: Ismail bin Ulayya told us, Mu’mal said: On the authority of Ayyub, and the others said: Ayyub told us, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Ibn Umar. H, Bundar told us, Yahya told us, Ubaid Allah told us, Nafi’ told me, on the authority of Ibn Umar. H. Bundar narrated to us, Hammad bin Masada also narrated to us, on the authority of Abdullah, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Ibn Umar. H, Ali bin Hajar told us, Ismail bin Jafar told us, Abdullah bin Dinar told us, Ibn Umar heard. H, Bundar told us, Abd al-Wahhab al-Thaqafi told us, Khaled told us, and Bundar also told us, Abd al-A’la, Khaled told us, H Al-San’ani narrated to us, Yazid bin Zurai’ narrated to us, Khalid narrated to us, on the authority of Abdullah bin Shaqiq, on the authority of Ibn Umar. They all mentioned: On the authority of the Prophet May God’s prayers and peace be upon him, he said: “The night prayer is two by two, so when the dawn approaches, pray the Witr prayer with a rak’ah.” This is the wording of the hadith of Abdul-Jabbar. With the news of Al-Zuhri. Abu Bakr said: I have discussed the methods of these reports in the issue that I dictated in response to those who claimed that performing the Witr prayer as a rak’ah is not permissible unless He was afraid of the morning, and I learned in that place that the ignorance of the one who said this article was evident to those with understanding and discernment."
"1073","Ahmad bin Abdah told us, Hammad bin Zaid told us, on the authority of Anas bin Sirin, he said: I said to Ibn Umar: Have you considered the two rak’ahs before the prayer? In the morning, should I read for a long time? He said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “used to pray two by two at night and pray the Witr prayer with one rak’ah.”"
"1074","Muhammad bin Miskin Al-Yamimi told us, Bishr, meaning Ibn Bakr, told us, Al-Awza’i told us, on the authority of Al-Muttalib bin Abdullah Al-Makhzoumi said: Ibn Umar was praying the Witr rak’ah, and a man came to him and asked him about the Witr prayer. He ordered him to separate it, and the man said: I am afraid For people to say: It is Petra, and Ibn Umar said: What do you mean by the Sunnah of God and His Messenger?"
"1075","Muhammad bin Miskin Al-Yamimi narrated to us, Yahya bin Hassan narrated to us, Sulaiman, who is Ibn Bilal narrated to us, on the authority of Shurahbil bin Saad, who said: I heard Jabir bin Abdullah said: I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, resting his camel, then he dismounted, prayed ten rak’ahs, and performed Witr with one, prayed two rak’ahs. He performed two rak'ahs, then he performed the Witr prayer with one, then he prayed the two rak'ahs of Fajr, then he led us in the Fajr prayer. I have covered this chapter in its entirety in the book “Al-Kabir” \\n[Commentary] 1075 - Al-Azami said: Its chain of transmission is authentic"
